      {
        "id": 27030282,
        "name": "MetallicBlue",
        "username": "MetallicBlue-7299",
        "avatar_template": "/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png",
        "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:36:12.401Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Truthfully the problem is you have a lot of cooks but no chef to direct what is happening.  So that is why you have one cook working on class set bonuses that clash with recent talent/hot fixes that another cook conjured together.</p>\n<p>Lack of coordination of communication between BlizZard employees themselves.  Doesn’t help there is a lack of communication between players and BlizZard.</p>\n<p>Communication is the key!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://d38bqls1q93fod.cloudfront.net/en/wow/images/emoji/twitter/+1.png?v=12\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":+1:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://d38bqls1q93fod.cloudfront.net/en/wow/images/emoji/twitter/surfing_man.png?v=12\" title=\":surfing_man:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":surfing_man:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <img src=\"https://d38bqls1q93fod.cloudfront.net/en/wow/images/emoji/twitter/surfing_woman.png?v=12\" title=\":surfing_woman:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":surfing_woman:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
